 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? It' completely normal to feel guilty. Many people do both office work and parenting, so think of it as part of being a modern family. Take quick breaks every twenty minutes or so. A short walk around the block is good for you too. Roughly five minutes is about right. You could walk around the block, do ten pushups or sit ups, or just step outside for fresh air. Probably not. A quick walk is much more effective. Plus, screen time before bed can disrupt sleep. You've got this. Just remember, taking care of yourself is self care.",
